{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-tomy-uk-boon-pivot-toddler-tower-sold-via-amazon-2607-0146","content_id":"d0e05ebd-76d9-4a5d-9325-1d195eb0a2fe","description":"Product Safety Report for TOMY UK Boon PIVOT Toddler Tower presenting a risk of injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"4d0fa6ad-9334-4227-b724-3f637071b975","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-07-20T17:07:06+01:00","id":"4d0fa6ad-9334-4227-b724-3f637071b975","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-07-20T17:07:06+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e47aa4763c49e9be693ee/2607-0146-product-safety-report-boon-pivot-toddler-tower.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: TOMY UK Boon PIVOT Toddler Tower sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of injuries because it may become unstable and tip over during use, trapping or injuring a child.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: TOMY UK have initiated a modification programme for affected products.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Baby High Chair</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>TOMY</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model Numbers</td>\n      <td>B11437 (Grey), B11578 (White). These numbers may be followed by letter or letter and number combination such as “A”, “A1”, or “A2” or “ME”.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>69028115679 (Grey) and 669028115785 (White)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0BNT2VKXM</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Foldable toddler tower sold in grey and white.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_4d0fa6ad-9334-4227-b724-3f637071b975\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e47aa4763c49e9be693ee/2607-0146-product-safety-report-boon-pivot-toddler-tower.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of injuries because it may become unstable and tip over during use, trapping or injuring a child.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>TOMY UK have initiated a modification programme for affected products. We recommend that owners stop using the product immediately and contact TOMY via <a href=\"mailto:response@tomy.com\">response@tomy.com</a> for a free repair kit. This kit includes weights for the product feet, which improve stability.</p>\n\n<p>For further information, access the Tomy website at the following link: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://recall.tomy.co.uk/uk-pivot.html\">Tomy: Product Recall - PIVOT</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2607-0146</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-20T16:07:55Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["modification-programme"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-07-20","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-07-20T17:07:55+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-tomy-uk-boon-pivot-toddler-tower-sold-via-amazon-2607-0146","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-tomy-uk-boon-pivot-toddler-tower-sold-via-amazon-2607-0146","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-tomy-uk-boon-pivot-toddler-tower-sold-via-amazon-2607-0146","content_id":"d0e05ebd-76d9-4a5d-9325-1d195eb0a2fe","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-20T16:07:55Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: TOMY UK Boon PIVOT Toddler Tower sold via Amazon (2607-0146)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-tomy-uk-boon-pivot-toddler-tower-sold-via-amazon-2607-0146","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"d